@reactions event.crossingLine.afterglow
// EW1 (events writer), Crossing the Line: Sunday 19:15 to Monday Day 8 (the plaque quoted back, the worst face).
? cue:event.crossingLine.afterglow
- Did you see the first-timers' faces at the punch? I'll remember that for years.   #funny
- Zeke says his face at his first Line was worse. I don't believe him.   #funny
- There's a plaque on the plaza now. With the date. We were there.   #warm
- First morning in the Veyli reach. The stars look different from the mess.
? cue:event.crossingLine.afterglow tier>=acquaintance
- Your first Line, {nick}. Keep the certificate. Everyone does.   #warm
? cue:event.crossingLine.afterglow flag:line.answer.punch
- I read the plaque. "Is this the part with the punch?" Classic.   #funny
? cue:event.crossingLine.afterglow flag:line.answer.watch
- "Even the ones on watch." The whole Watch has read that plaque.   #warm
? cue:event.crossingLine.afterglow flag:line.answer.proud
- "We came a long way. We're glad we did." I read it twice.   #warm
? cue:event.crossingLine.afterglow dept:survey
- New reach. Survey's had their noses to the windows since yesterday.   #funny
// the Envoy stays away from the rite by courtesy (they/them); one line, nothing more
? cue:event.crossingLine.afterglow who:saruth
- A Veyli does not watch another people's rite. I hope it was a good one.
